# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repo and on checkout.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise hand a Windows
# clone CRLF copies of everything. The concrete consequence here is not
# theoretical:
#
#   The workflow JSONs are exported byte-for-byte from the running n8n instance
#   and re-verified against it. A checkout that silently rewrites their line
#   endings breaks exactly the property the export process exists to guarantee.
#
# Backported from Case Study 3, which hit this first.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.json  text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.pdf   binary
